<section class="hero service-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About us</p><div class="hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET WATER HEATER BOYS</p><h1>Real people.<br/>Good work.<br/><em>Local roots.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Water Heater Boys started as a family-run operation in California, bringing neighborly, no-nonsense plumbing service to homes across the Bay Area.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="tel:6508442305">Talk to our team ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/#work">See our work ↗</a></div></div><aside class="service-summary"><p class="eyebrow">STRAIGHTFORWARD FROM THE START</p><h2>A real person.<br/>A clear plan.<br/>A job done with care.</h2><p>We believe in real people answering phones, clear quotes without hidden fees, and showing up when we say we will.</p><a class="text-link" href="#our-approach">Our approach ↓</a></aside></div></div></section>
