<section class="area-section"><div class="wrap area-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROUD TO WORK WHERE YOU LIVE</p><h2>Bay Area homes.<br/>A local crew.</h2></div><div><p>We serve homes and businesses across San Francisco, the Peninsula, the East Bay, and the South Bay—all the way down to San Jose. Contact us to discuss your project and scheduling.</p><a class="text-link" href="/service-areas/">Explore our service area ↗</a></div></div></section>
